The Siem Reap Provincial Administration has announced that Yangzhou Polytechnic University, Jiangsu Province, has offered 10 undergraduate scholarships to the Siem Reap Provincial Administration to provide students living in Siem Reap.
According to the provincial government, there are 13 majors offered by Yangzhou Polytechnic University. The provincial administration has appealed to students wishing to study at the above university to contact the provincial hall before August 16.
