Mr. Thong Khon made this statement during a meeting with the working group of the Cambodian People's Party to help Baray district, including party president and party members at the district and commune levels through the video Zoom Meeting on the morning of the 7th. August 2021.
The work mentioned in this meeting is two main points, including:
First, the work to fight against the spread of Kovid-19 and the work to vaccinate against Kovid-19 was introduced by Mr. Thong Khon with some additional points such as:
* Reduce the number of gatherings, especially the district inspector, must regularly monitor the activities of gambling and prevent drinking gatherings, which pose a high risk of transmission and infection of Kovid-19.
Second: Preparatory work for the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election 2022:
* Must follow the party's policy in selecting candidates for each commune to increase the trust of local people. At this point, Mr. Thong Khon advised the district-commune party to try to find a candidate who is one-third of the youth, but must also be someone who is satisfied, supportive and capable enough.
* Efforts must be made to expand party members at the grassroots level, but in order to expand party members, the authorities must also help people have a decent living, make people happy, satisfied, support, do not hurt them absolutely. He said that as district authorities, commune authorities must participate in protecting the legitimate interests of the people, but also not to protect the wicked.
