"According to the forecast and the emergence of the dry season from July to the end of August, it can cause drought and seriously affect all kinds of crops of farmers, especially the cultivation. "Rice production in rural areas is completely dependent on rainfall, and this effect is already happening to some farmers in some districts of Kampong Speu province."
