According to Mr. Doul Son, Technical Officer of Kampong Cham Provincial Investment Planning Office, one concrete road is more than 1,300 meters long, 6 meters wide and another line is more than 200 meters long and 5 meters wide, and the construction of drainage is more than 1 meter long. 000 meters and sewers to be repaired more than 400 meters long. The above construction project is a construction project in the 2022 budget of Kampong Cham Provincial Administration.
The same technical official also reminded that last year, during the rainy season, the Kampong Cham provincial authorities led by Mr. Un Chanda always inspected every time there was a flood in some villages in Boeung Kok commune to find a solution. Therefore, until now, the authorities of Kampong Cham province have developed the construction of concrete roads and the construction of drainage to avoid flooding by rain like in previous years.
