Views on the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen
(Phnom Penh): Starting from the life of a farmer's son, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has become one of the top leaders in Cambodia who must take responsibility and be highly responsible for the fate of the nation and the people.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen from childhood intended only to be a teacher to share knowledge to the people. However, due to the social situation, which was devastated by the crisis of war, Hun Bonal decided to join a resistance movement at the request of Samdech Norodom Sihanouk to overthrow Lon Nol's republic in April 1970.
Due to the situation in the country, the crisis of war has pushed this Cambodian to become more responsible for Cambodian society, such as leading the movement to find resistance in 1977, leading the force to overthrow the genocidal regime of Paul. Pot until success on January 7, 1979 and so on.
Since the overthrow of the genocidal regime, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has pushed his life deeper into the cause of the nation and the people at a time when the nation and its people are in a miserable state of the legacy of the fires of war and the field regime. Killed Pol Pot.
Since 1985, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has become increasingly responsible for the fate of the nation and its people. Not only addressing the lives of the people, building the nation, this young leader also faces the flames of war that continue to plague Cambodian society.
On the one hand, it strives to build the national economy and boost the livelihood of the people, and on the other hand strives to find peace through the introduction of win-win politics. Finally, Cambodia's young leader Techo Sen completely extinguished the flames of the 1998 war, the first peace and unity in Cambodian society since the fall of the Angkorian Empire.
For about 36 years, as the person in charge of the destiny of the nation and the people of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has been seen as a prominent leader with the ability to lead the nation. Many great achievements under the leadership of Samdech Techo are highlighted.
Overcoming all difficulties for the nation and the people of Cambodia has led Samdech Techo Hun Sen to become a leader who is respected, loved and democratically elected to be the Prime Minister for six consecutive terms. No one can replace this position.
On the occasion of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's 69th and 70th birthdays on August 5, 2021, many heroic examples of his leadership were highlighted by the clergy and leaders from major institutions. Of the nation and the people of all classes.
The Board of Priests of the Kingdom of Cambodia emphasized that as the leader of the Royal Government of Cambodia, who was heroic, wise and skillful, Samdech Techo Hun Sen always devoted his body, mind and spirit to sincerely serve the cause of nation, religion and The King, through his genius, wisdom, potential and superior excellence, has brought peace, political stability, national unity and development in all areas of society.
Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate, emphasized that under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister, Cambodia has achieved full peace, national unity, territorial integrity, political stability, security, public order and development in all areas.
"This is a testament to Samdech Techo's wise leadership, which makes the people support and appreciate his heroism. With Samdech Techo Prime Minister as the Leader, the people of Cambodia will continue to enjoy peace and happiness, and the Kingdom of Cambodia will continue to gain prestige and excellence around the world. This is the confirmation of Samdech Say Chhum.
Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth, Minister of Economy and Finance, said that Samdech Techo is an example of a talented and realistic leader. As the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, he has sacrificed his physical and mental strength to lead the country to achieve complete peace, national unity, political stability and social order, which are indispensable resources for supporting the development of the nation. Progressive progress.
Mrs. Ing Kantha Phavi, Minister of Women's Affairs, expressed her gratitude to Samdech Techo Prime Minister for his past and present efforts to sacrifice his strength for the cause of defending the land, reconciling the nation and bringing complete peace to the nation. And the population, especially in the context of the spread of Kovid 19.
The Minister of Women's Affairs said, "Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit always consider and pay attention to the well-being, security, safety and life of all people, so that Cambodia can maintain economic stability and public order." "Better."
General Neth Savoeun, General Commissioner of the National Police, expressed his admiration for the great merits of Samdech Techo who sacrificed all his physical, mental, intellectual and personal well-being, as well as sacrificed his life for peace, national reunification. And has transformed Cambodia from a chronic war into a country with national unity, national sovereignty and full territorial integrity, as well as development in all areas.
In addition to the above-mentioned views, they also observed messages on social media wishing Samdech Techo a happy birthday and expressed their admiration and gratitude for the heroism of Samdech Techo Prime Minister in his leadership efforts. And build Cambodian society to achieve prosperity and overcome many difficulties for the Cambodian nation and people.
They see that under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Cambodian society has developed, the national prestige, the people live a life and a dignified humanity, unlike more than 40 years ago, who had to live in the sea. Blood and tears.
