(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, this morning, August 5, 2021, chaired a meeting of the Inter-Ministerial Commission to host the ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting and Meeting. Involved in the Kingdom of Cambodia in 2022, with Cambodia as the rotating chair from Brunei.
The meeting was held through the video zoom system with the participation of representatives of relevant ministries and institutions, as well as the leadership of the Ministry of National Defense, the Commander-in-Chief and some units under the Ministry of National Defense.
The contents of the 16th ASEAN Defense Ministers 'Meeting and related meetings in 2022 chaired by Cambodia include: priority topics, review of concept documents, discussion documents and calendar schedule for the 16th ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting; Relevant meetings in 2022 are scheduled to be held in both Phnom Penh and Siem Reap.
