Sixteen-year-old Soviona is in the 11th grade at a private school in Phnom Penh, although she can continue her education from a distance. But she still wants to see the school reopen to normal communication with teachers and friends at school.
After Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister, announced that he allowed children and young people to be vaccinated against Kovid 19 to study the possibility of reopening the school, Sovanna expressed her happiness.
