Total trade between Cambodia and China has always exceeded the plan set by the two heads of government. In fact, in 2017, total trade increased by 16% to 5.8 billion US dollars, exceeding the target. In 2020, as the two countries were affected by the 19-crisis Kovid crisis, growth slowed by 5 percent, but total bilateral trade remained large at more than $ 8 billion.
