Mr. Phal Vandy said that any financial service that is not a member of the Cambodian Microfinance Association without the recognition of the National Bank of Cambodia, all financial services do not have customer protection.
In addition, the Executive Director of the Cambodian Microfinance Association emphasized that the microfinance sector is a special sector, which is like a blood vessel of the national economy, and this sector has contributed and is very important to the people.
Mr. Phal Vandy added that the microfinance sector has contributed to the promotion of responsible access to financial services, especially in contributing to social development.
Please be informed that the Cambodian Microfinance Association is the only institution representing all legally registered microfinance institutions in close cooperation with the National Bank of Cambodia, the Cambodian Banking Association, the Cambodian Credit Bureau and other development partners.
The Microfinance Association is a professional association that contributes to the prosperity and sustainability of the microfinance sector in Cambodia by promoting economic growth and development.
