In the fight against drugs, please call on law enforcement forces and all citizens to participate in the implementation of the anti-drug slogan "3 do not 1 report".
First, do not be involved, do not trade: do not share, do not be backing, do not think and do not use drugs. Do not exempt: Do not relax law enforcement on drug offenders. All relevant authorities must enforce the law strictly and honestly in their profession, and everyone must respect and enforce the law.
And 1 report: to report and provide information to the authorities on the subject of trafficking, distribution, use of processing sites and illegal drug storage locations to the authorities.
