People cheated individuals to become officials of the Ministry of Public Works because they want to get a driver's license without an exam
(Phnom Penh): Because they want to get a driver's license without passing the exam, some people have been deceived by crooks who pretend to be officials of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport.
The people who were cheated in both cases were cheated by a Facebook user with the same account name "Pheaktra Public Works and Transport". According to the victim told Fresh News, the person claimed that he could get a driver's license without having to pass an exam with the Ministry of Public Works and Transport.
It costs about $ 500 to get a driver's license without the exam. The way of this scam is that the scammer tempted the person who wants to get the driver's license to send the relevant documents, then also advised to send the money through Wing in two stages.
The fraudulent act of fraudsters to obtain a driver's license without this exam is not the only two cases above. In the past, there have been many reports under such images.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, later led the ministry, made great efforts to eliminate the complexity of driver's license services, as well as to eliminate corruption in driving licenses, which is a problem in the ministry.
The senior minister once claimed that no driver's license can be obtained without an exam. He also warned of legal action against officials who consider corruption in the issuance of driver's licenses.
According to Mr. Sothea Yut, this scammer always tries to create various Facebook accounts to commit fraud, making it difficult to find this scammer and bring him to justice.
Mr. Sothea Yut also called on the people to think and consider carefully before believing in the comfort of such crooks. He confirmed that the Ministry does not allow the issuance of driver's licenses without proper examination. Mr. Kao Thach Meets and Brings Chinese Traditional Medicine, Anti-Kovid Material and Some Funds Donated by Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth to Khsach Kandal District Youth Group
