(Phnom Penh): World Park Day is celebrated on July 31, 2021 to commemorate Rangers officers who were killed or injured in the mission of protecting the environment, conserving natural resources and celebrating their work. Park rangers who have sacrificed their physical and mental strength to protect the world's natural and cultural heritage.
