The Minister's attention comes at a time when people are feeling worried, scared, hurt, miserable, and complaining about the fact that some professional police forces have stopped their cultivation activities on their farmland and confiscated their machinery. They were involved in farming activities on their farms under the accusation that people were clearing forest cover or touching land in protected areas.
After raising this issue, President Thong Khon assigned the Royal Government team to visit Kampong Thom province as well as the Kampong Thom provincial administration to open a large-scale solution to the problem of people throughout Kampong Thom province who were confiscated by the police. A special machine is a case in Stong district, Prasat Balang district and other places to return the machine to the people without having to pay a fine.
Minister Thong Khon continued, "We, as a working group of the Royal Government together with the provincial administration, must find a mechanism or working group to examine and find an appropriate solution to this case, without leaving it for a long time, which will make "It does not affect the minds and fears of the people."
In addition, the Commune / Sangkat Council Election of the 5th Mandate 2022 is approaching (Election Day is Sunday, June 05, 2022), that is, there are only about 10 months left until the Royal Government Working Group All localities in Kampong Thom province must work hard to do good deeds, try to examine and solve the challenges, concerns and necessary requests of local people in order to increase the trust and confidence of the people in the Royal Government of Cambodia.
The Minister also instructed the working group of the Royal Government to visit Kampong Thom and Kampong Thom Provincial Administration to continue to eliminate inactivity and shortcomings that affect the minds and livelihoods of the people and to continue to do good deeds to increase trust. Trust and warmth to the people.
Mr. Thong Khon urges the Royal Government to visit Kampong Thom and the provincial administration to end the problems for the people as soon as possible, especially before the 2022 Commune / Sangkat Council Election
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism and Chairman of the Royal Government of Kampong Thom Province, urged the Royal Government of Kampong Thom Province as well as the Kampong Thom Provincial Administration to work together to solve problems for the people. There are 15 important points to be completed before the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election 2022.
On that occasion, Minister Thong Khon mentioned the work results, challenges, concerns and suggestions that occur in Kampong Thom, which all working groups present in this meeting must think together, work together and work together. Responsible.
First, to promote the dissemination and implementation of Circular No. 04 dated 28 July 2021 of the Royal Government on the launch of a campaign to strengthen measures to combat and prevent the spread of Kovid-19 to be effective.
Second, continue to carry out work to fight and prevent the spread of Kovid-19 and Kovid-19 vaccination campaign to the people in the 9 districts of Kampong Thom province.
Fourth, continue to support provincial and municipal administrations in combating and preventing the spread of Kovid-19 disease and vaccination campaign.
Fifth, continue to take care of and support poor families who have family members with Kovid-19 disease (who are being treated for the disease), those who are being treated for measles in the center or at home, and those who have died of Kovid 19 disease.
Sixth, continue to promote agriculture and crop production of the people during this rainy season and be prepared to prevent and save the lives of people and rice in case of natural disasters such as wind, flood, rain, water. Flooding or damage to people's rice fields.
Seventh, continue to promote the examination and resolution of the necessary priority work, including: land clearing work in area 3, area 2 and land of the whispering conservation area.
Eighth: Based on the principle of protecting the legitimate interests of the people, handed over to the provincial governor, relevant departments and authorities to examine and solve the case of confiscation of people's machinery in Stong district, Prasat Balang district and other places by handing over the equipment The machine returns to the people.
Ninth: Continue to strengthen security, public order and social security through the implementation of safe village-commune policy.
10th: Continue to strive to promote the provision of public services with a sense of responsibility, transparency and accountability to the people.
Eleventh: Continue to promote the issuance of new model Khmer identity cards to all citizens.
Twelfth: Continue to examine and address the challenges, concerns and necessary requests of local people.
13th: Prepare to host the 7th River Festival in March 2022. In the event that the situation in Kovid is relieved, the national working group and the provincial administration can immediately prepare to participate in reopening the economy and society.
14th: Continue to eliminate inactivity and shortcomings that affect the minds and lives of the people.
Fifth, continue to do good deeds to increase the trust, confidence and warmth of the people on the Royal Government.
