From the pressure on scientists who adhere to the scientific spirit to the issuance of orders for intelligence agencies to reach a conclusion on the work to track the origin of the virus within 90 days to the pressure on organizations. World Health will force the organization to launch a plan to track down the origins of the next-generation virus, which violates the spirit of science and the principles of cooperation.
