Mr. Steng Sokhom encouraged the team to continue this good work by paying attention to a good vaccination plan and prevent the spread of Kovid 19.
On the morning of the same day, Mr. Steng Sokhom also invited to visit and encourage the doctors who are helping to treat 19 people with positive Kovid 19 and 19 Kovid patients at Hun Sen Kamchay Mear High School.
There, Mr. Steng Sokhom praised the Kamchay Mear District 19 Kovid Fighting Team for their efforts to prevent the spread of Kovid 19, a community that erupted in Kamchay Mear District last week, to reduce and treat those born there. Kovid 19 healed many people and caused a significant drop in the number of local acupuncturists.
In fact, during the 19-Kovid eruption in a garment factory in North Smong commune in mid-July, Kamchay Mear district had 19 to 285 Kovid-positive people, including 258 factory workers and ordinary people. There were 27 people, while 711 were women and 575 were women.
A total of 211 patients were admitted to Hun Sen Kamchay Mear High School and 74 were admitted to Prey Veng Provincial Referral Hospital. However, as of July 27, there are about 140 patients who have been cured. At present, there are only 71 patients left in Hun Sen Kamchay Mear High School. As for those who are doing charitable work in the eight commune charitable centers, there are 375 people, a decrease of about 336 people.
Mr. Steng Sokhom also expressed his condolences to 19 Kovid patients who died of a serious illness when they arrived at the center. His condition was serious and he expressed his condolences to the families of the victims.
On that occasion, Mr. Steng Sokhom also encouraged patients who are recovering to try to follow the instructions of the doctor, take medicine according to the order, try to eat enough food, maintain good hygiene, sleep a lot. And need to exercise as well.
"If you do this, you will be healed of Kovid 19 in the near future," he said. And when you are healed and return, do not forget to overcome Kovid 19, you must adhere to health measures to protect your personal health and safety, as well as the well-being of our family, community and society as a whole. .
At the same time, Mr. Steng Sokhom also donated $ 650 for the purchase of 5 oxygen tubes at Hun Sen Kamchay Mear High School Medical Center.
Later in the morning, Mr. Steng Sokhom inspected the construction of a 52-meter-long and 4-meter-wide concrete road connecting Krabao Commune Hall to Krabao Commune Water Treatment Plant at a cost of $ 2,500. United States.
Mr. HUN Many: Tomorrow is the 3rd anniversary of the 6th National Assembly election in accordance with the Constitution of Cambodia, the Cambodian People's Party is with the people in all circumstances
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hun Many, Member of Parliament from the Cambodian People's Party, who is a member of the Party Central Committee and President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, said that tomorrow, July 29, 2019, tomorrow is the third anniversary of the general election. Election of the 6th legislature in accordance with the Constitution of Cambodia.
Through Facebook, Mr. Hun Many said that three years ago, on that day, a large number of Cambodians who had the right to vote and registered to vote went out to exercise their rights to choose the party they deemed worthy. It believes in and trusts to steer Cambodian ships and lead national policy.
83.02% of the total registered voters chose their favorite party out of the 20 political parties that participated in the election. Of the 83.02% of those who went to the polls, more than 76% voted in favor of the CPP to lead the National Assembly and the Royal Government in the sixth term.
In addition, Cambodia has set a record in implementing its vaccination strategies and campaigns, which so far have ensured that we have adequate vaccines sourced from around the world for at least 10 people. Millions. The number of vaccines that Cambodia has been receiving and is preparing to send can ensure that the vaccination campaign can run smoothly and without worrying about the shortage of vaccines.
The CPP has achieved great achievements for the motherland, but there is still a lot of work to be done so that the people can overcome the difficult times of the 19 epidemic of Kovid and reach the national economy and work together Journey to a brighter future. Believe in the CPP and the party will be with us in all circumstances and do everything possible to create a bright environment for today and the future.
