Commentary: Obeying the scientific team and cooperating honestly to overcome infectious diseases and find the source of the virus
BEIJING (Reuters) - "The virus is leaking from Wuhan laboratories" is a recurring claim that some Western countries are tired of, despite the fact that experts from the World Health Organization have conducted research in Wuhan directly. "There is almost zero probability that the virus has leaked from the Wuhan laboratory," which is a clear scientific proof to disprove the above claim.
After all, we see that some Western countries, especially those under US influence, do not care what the scientific evidence is, only that they are blindly shouting at the United States.
After the 19 epidemics of Kovid were brought under control, China arranged for a World Health Organization (WHO) team to conduct a field study at the Wuhan Laboratory and related sites. But the results are not the same as the attempts of some American politicians, so despite the strong scientific evidence, they still try to shout out the recognition of this prestigious research report.
It is not hard to see that the wise leaders of the world have done their best to prevent the spread of infectious diseases in line with their country's situation and seek international cooperation to Help its people get out of the abyss of death soon, as well as restore the economy and production, return people to normal life as much as possible.
