1. For pharmaceutical importers and distributors, they need to distribute quick test for antigen Kovid-19 with registration number from the Ministry of Health to pharmacies, sub-pharmacies, private hospitals, polyclinics, clinics and clinics.
2: For pharmacies, sub-pharmacies must buy only the quick test to find the antidote Kovid-19 with the serial number from the Ministry of Health and sell to health professionals and the general public to use and prohibit the sale and purchase of this quick test online of all kinds .
3: For health professionals and citizens to buy a quick test for antiviral Kovid-19 with the correct registration number from a pharmacy, sub-pharmacy and must avoid buying this quick test kit from all kinds of online because this test kit Proper care must be taken and the source must be clear, otherwise you may face a quick test of incorrect quality or even a counterfeit product.
