(Ratanakkiri): The spokesman of Ratanakkiri Provincial Hall, Mr. Nhem Sam Oeun, said that the goods entering and leaving Vietnam through the international border is not wrong, if transported through the corridor is wrong and a secret activity. The spokesman of Ratanakkiri Provincial Hall said that there was a recent incident of smuggling cigarettes into Vietnam through the corridor without inspection.
Speaking to Fresh News, the spokesman said that in order to prevent the spread of 19 communicable diseases in Cambodia, the Royal Government has decided to temporarily suspend the entry and exit of Cambodian-Vietnamese workers. Technical, staff of Vietnamese companies for one month, implemented from July 18, 2021 onwards.
