(Phnom Penh): Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh, this morning, July 26, 2021, opened the construction site of a road with a length of more than 1 km from Street 217 in front of Old Stung Meanchey Market to Street 271 in front of Russian Hospital. From already dealing with the impact with the people two weeks ago.
