Two More Hospitals and Health Centers Receive Cambodian Pure Water from "Cambodian Spirit" Campaign
(Phnom Penh): Two hospitals and health centers, including Prek Eang Health Center and Chak Angre Health Center, received 300 cases of Cambodian pure water from the "Cambodian Spirit" campaign on July 23, 2021.
This is part of a plan to donate 2,000 cases of Cambodian fresh water to 20 hospitals and health centers in Phnom Penh and Kandal to join the fight against the spread of Kovid-19, which began on July 20. .
