Please note that the tycoon "Leng" is nicknamed "Duke Chet Dharma" or "Duke of Humanity". In the family of farmers, the "Leng" family, who were born in Prey Veng province, did not have much opportunity to study and drifted to South Korea to work as laborers in that country, looking for money to support themselves and their families.
