Russia's support for the implementation of the "Roadmap on the Plan for the Rehabilitation and Rehabilitation of Cambodia's Tourism in and After the Kovid-19 Crisis"
* Cooperation to promote direct flights between Cambodia and Russia
* Initiative for the establishment of an ASEAN-Russia tourism center.
