(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chrek Soknim, President of the Association of Appraisers and Real Estate Agents of Cambodia, said that Cambodia is considered by many investors as a country with potential for investment.
He said such investors' claims were due to the fact that they had better economic stability and stronger politics than other ASEAN countries.
