(Phnom Penh): Mr. Kong Vibol, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister and Royal Government Delegate in charge of the Director General of the General Department of Taxation, said that the implementation of the payment of taxes on all means of transport and vehicles online is very effective. Easy access to the public, especially during the outbreak of Kovid 19.
Mr. Kong Vibol said, "We have now decided that the tax on public transport can be paid at the bank and at the branch, but now the disease of Kovid 19 continues to spread, so in the past I have advised to work. Implement an online tax payment program so that all taxpayers who have not yet paid their taxes can pay their taxes online. ”
He pointed out that in case the public finds it difficult to pay taxes at banks or other branches due to Kovid 19 disease, the public can access the tax website and pay the tax by means of online transportation with the ability to pay the vehicle tax. 10 units and the General Department of Taxation will arrange for the degree to be posted to any house or location where the vehicle owner wishes to have the tax transported to that place.
Mr. Kong Vibol stated that the public can pay taxes online and can view the history of tax payment of each vehicle and can pay 10 vehicles at a time. This is another new product of the General Department of Taxation, which develops tax payment software for all types of vehicles online, and it is easier for the public to simply type in a vehicle number, type in a vehicle, and it will jump into the tax system.
