The General Secretariat of the Senate would like to express its deep gratitude and appreciation for the above assistance. The General Secretariat of the Senate has been using these grants effectively with the utmost care and responsibility.
As for the parliamentary cooperation within the framework of the two sides, the legislatures of the two countries will continue to nurture and strengthen the friendship and cooperation continuously through the exchange of visits between senior leaders of the Cambodian Senate and the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference. In addition, within the multilateral framework of the two countries' parliaments, there is mutual support in regional and international forums.
At the same time, Mr. Oum Sarith strongly believes that the People's Republic of China, through the Chinese Embassy in the Kingdom of Cambodia, will continue to assist the Cambodian Senate in the upcoming 5th legislature, especially on human resource development, construction of new Senate Assembly Hall, system development. Modern Information Technology and the construction of the Senate Library as a Digital Library.
