Commentary: Intentionally violating the American Red Line is no different than playing with fire that will actually burn itself.
BEIJING, July 15 (Xinhua) - A US military transport plane landed in Taiwan on July 15. This is a dangerous act that causes malicious intent and is also an act of fire that violently violates China's red line, which seriously violates the provisions of the three joint declarations between China and the United States.
Recall that after taking office, the current US government has claimed to adhere to the one-China policy, but in fact the United States has committed dangerous acts that have long been indulging in and encouraging separatist forces to want Taiwan independence. Taiwan to become a leader in the US stockpile strategy to curb China's development in all its aspects.
The wrongdoing not only aggravated the situation in the Taiwan Strait and dragged Taiwan into a dangerous precipice, but also strained Sino-US relations day by day.
Please note that Taiwan is an inseparable part of Chinese territory, this is a fundamental fact that the international community generally recognizes. In the face of a strong and united Chinese people, any attempt to divide China will never succeed.
China has never interfered in the internal affairs of other countries, but China does not allow other countries to interfere in its internal affairs. No one can underestimate the strong determination, will and determination of the Chinese people and the Chinese army in defending national sovereignty and territorial integrity.
