He also recommended the newly appointed management officers to work hard with a high level of conscience and responsibility in their duties as managers and leaders.
Please note that the National University of Battambang is the only national higher education institution in the Northwest Zone, which is trusted by students and students can be a bright future.
The National University of Battambang was established on the initiative and fundraiser by Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior in 2007. The event is organized in accordance with safety standards set by the Ministry of Health and the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports.
New "Techo" Business Training Center signs MoU with the Federation of Finance and Technology of Cambodia to promote technology in Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of July 16, 2021, the new business training center "Techo" and the Association of the Federation of Finance and Technology of Cambodia held a signing ceremony of the Memorandum of Understanding.
The Memorandum of Understanding was signed by Dr. Taing Nguon Ly, Director of the "Techo" New Business Training Center and Mr. Pil Remy Sisophon, President of the Federation of Financial and Technological Associations of Cambodia.
The purpose of this Memorandum of Understanding is to achieve the common goal of developing new technology, finance, business, technology and other key areas that will promote the development of technology in Cambodia and to improve the quality of entrepreneurs and investors in Cambodia. Personally, as well as in countries that are interested in investing in Cambodia.
This cooperation will also focus on the development of a digital framework for new technologies, financial technologies, new businesses and entrepreneurs in Cambodia in line with the digitalization of the digital market in the 21st century.
The new Techo Training Center and the Association of the Federation of Finance and Technology of Cambodia also aim to jointly develop the Sandbox, which promotes digitalization of the financial technology and technology entrepreneurship, as well as cooperation between the private sector and the private sector. Public.
Dr. Tang Nguonly said that the Memorandum of Understanding reflects the bilateral efforts to promote and facilitate the development and promotion of new businesses in the field of financial technology and digital technology ecosystems as a whole. The new "Techo" Business Training Center will start this cooperation through the center's business acceleration program in the near future.
Weena Llona, Executive Director of the Federation of Financial and Technological Associations of Cambodia, also revealed that "to enter the modernization of the future, we must focus on young people and talented individuals. We are pleased to partner with the new "Techo" Business Training Center, which will drive Cambodia's entrepreneurial growth towards the development of world-class technology, financial technology and entrepreneurship. "
Emphasize that the new business training center "Techo" is a public administrative institution under the auspices of the Ministry of Economy and Finance of Cambodia. The "Techo" New Business Center has an obligation to accelerate new business ventures by increasing entrepreneurial capacity and innovation through the Center's programs and services.
