At the same time, the level of inter-parliamentary cooperation in the region and beyond has been enhanced with new qualities and potential, not only between North and South, but also South-South cooperation. General knowledge: What is seabed tourism?
(Phnom Penh): Seabed tourism is an important attraction for high-level tourism and helps to promote national tourism. What is seabed tourism?
Seabed tourism refers to tourists' diving activities to appreciate the beauty of seabed resources through standard equipment and techniques and to be able to stay at least one night at those destinations. The main tourist attractions in the seabed tourism industry are the seabed biodiversity, including beautiful corals, colorful small and large fish and other sea creatures. Testing your abilities can also be a motivating factor.
The potential negative impacts of the natural environment on seabed tourism activities have been studied in countries such as Malaysia and Thailand, where most of the impacts include pollution from engine oil, dumping of anchors. Into the sea to stabilize the boat, which can cause the coral to explode and the accumulation of solids.
Topics that should be further studied in the seabed tourism sector for Cambodia include:
* Searching for tourism market segments for seabed tourism activities in the Cambodian tourism industry (study of segregation of national and foreign tourism market segments).
* Incentives for tour operators on seabed tourism services.
* Job opportunities and income from seabed tourism business (in-depth case in tourism and economy).
Source: Department of Local Tourism Promotion and Public Awareness Education of the Ministry of Tourism
