Ministry of Tourism issues circular on the use of tourism vocational training system
* Capital-Provincial Departments of Tourism shall prepare professional officers to facilitate the use in the tourism vocational training system.
* Tourism vocational training institutions, tourism vocational training schools, public and private entities, companies and development partners that provide skills training services in tourism, hospitality and travel and capacity assessment centers can use the tourism vocational training system as The basis for conducting training courses and assessing their online competencies.
All stakeholders must include data related to the training and assess their competencies in tourism, hospitality and travel skills into the tourism vocational training system.
