On 13 July, Major General Seng Thearin, in the presence of Major General Sith Loh, Banteay Meanchey Provincial Police Commissioner, Brigadier General Born Bin, Provincial Gendarmerie Commander, Brigadier General Sing Tum, Commander of the 51st Infantry Brigade Continued to inspect the vaccination site for Kovid 19 to the people by a group of mobile vehicles in Serei Sophorn.
Major General Seng Thearin said that the vaccination process in Serei Sophorn City was organized by the troops of the 5th Army Division at 8 locations. All locations are set up and run for the general public from early morning until late afternoon. In addition, the army team also organized a group of mobile vehicles that the Royal Government has equipped two armies for mobile to vaccinate people to make it easier to get closer to the people.
Lt. Gen. Seng Thearin confirmed that all vaccination sites were operating well and the people were happy to receive the vaccination. He noted that many people have volunteered to be vaccinated by the authorities.
However, Major General Seng Thearin urged the forces to pay attention to the vaccination work and called on the people after receiving the vaccination, do not forget to follow the instructions of the medical team. Generations during the vaccination.
In response to the Kovid 19 vaccine, people were overjoyed to receive the Kovid 19 vaccine. They thanked Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, for taking care of the people, as well as the authorities and the vaccination team.
