* Suspended business activities for food stalls, restaurants, cafes, bars and restaurants in hotels, etc. Accepts customers to come and eat in their business premises, but can do business in the form of packaging.
* Gatherings, gatherings, meals, drinks, alcohol, and other gatherings are temporarily suspended, except in the following cases:
Funeral arrangements in accordance with the regulations of the competent authorities - Meetings of health workers who perform emergency work and other duties - Meetings of competent authorities, forces, administrative units at all levels to perform care work Maintain security, order and public order - gathering people who are necessary to serve the public interest or for other purposes as determined by the competent authorities.
