All victims want to ask the court to speed up and expedite the process of handing over all the money from the confiscation of land and debtors to all victims as soon as possible, not to procrastinate. Or another procedure because all the victims are waiting for these reimbursements to be used for medical treatment.
Victims and the families of the victims added that they suffered and suffered the loss of their loved ones for seven years. . On the contrary, they still do not receive the light of justice.
