According to a press release issued by the Cambodian People's Party, three important outcomes were achieved at this important summit:
1. Ask political parties in all countries to commit to building common values, including peace, development, equality, justice, democracy and freedom.
2. All political parties need to take active action to implement the 2030 United Nations Sustainable Development Goals to coordinate macroeconomic policies, strengthen global cooperation on technological innovation and promote knowledge and technology sharing.
3. Political parties from all countries must be committed to facilitating exchanges and mutual learning on civilization, strong people-to-people relations, as well as cooperation in the fields of education, science and technology, culture and arts, sports and tourism. And between research institutions.
It should be noted that this summit is the highest and largest meeting of world political parties organized by the Communist Party of China and organized in the form of close interaction and in-depth dialogue.
