On behalf of the Cambodia-China Friendship Association, Mr. Ek Sam Ol would like to declare his support for the policy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, which adheres to the one-China policy, which Samdech Techo considers China as the foundation of building, defending peace and prosperity. People.
