She continued that the donation at this time is pure and clear of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kit Prith Bundith, as well as some other Buddhists to participate in supporting the field of Buddhism as the state religion to grow. On the other hand, referring to the rainy season, all monks can not perform the Ben Bath and wait for the rainy season for up to 3 months.
Each pagoda received 500,000 Riels from the Duke of Priest Moha Upasika Vivathana Bun Seangly, 1 million Riels from Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, as well as some Buddhist suffixes.
