TOP NEWS: The Cambodian People's Party is ready to work closely with the Chinese Communist Party to promote cooperation, strategic partnership in all fields and jointly build a common destiny community
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and President of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP), confirmed that the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) is ready to work closely with the Communist Party of China (CPC) to promote strategic partnership cooperation. All corners and together build a common destiny community between the two countries.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen made this remark to Chinese President Xi Jinping, Secretary-General of the CPC Central Committee, in a message on July 2, 2021, in response to the congratulatory message from the President of the People's Republic of China. For the 70th anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party.
In a message received by Fresh News, Hun Sen stated: "The CPP is ready to work closely with the Chinese Communist Party to promote comprehensive strategic partnership cooperation between the two countries. "Our two countries will jointly build a community of common destiny for Cambodia and China for the real benefit of our two countries and peoples, as well as for peace, stability and prosperity in the region and the world."
Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his pleasure to observe the development of close relations and communication between the Cambodian People's Party and the Chinese Communist Party.
"Based on the political trust and mutual support of our two parties, I firmly believe that the existing close relations and cooperation between Cambodia and China will be strengthened," he said. "And expand further in the coming years."
Please note that June 28, 2021 is the 70th anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party. The Cambodian People's Party, which has been in power through elections for six terms, was formed on June 28, 1951, with the original name of the Khmer Revolutionary People's Party, which originated from the patriotic movement of the Cambodian people. Against the colonists for national independence.
The party led the people to fight valiantly to liberate the country from foreign aggression and to overthrow the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, save the nation in time, which completely ended the darkest period. Of Cambodia and open a new page in the history of the reconstruction of the territory of the Cambodian people on the path of peace, national unity, democracy and development.
