The Minister and the Ambassador affirmed that the flow of trade between Cambodia and Vietnam should be smoother, even in the context of the Kovid 19 crisis.
The Minister also briefed on the progress of the ratification of regional and bilateral trade agreements, which Cambodia has concluded. In addition, the two sides are committed to further boosting trade and investment cooperation to the level desired by both countries.
Minister Pan Sosak expressed his deep gratitude to the Government of Vietnam for its support and assistance in all areas to Cambodia. The minister also wished Ambassador Vu Quang Minh continued success in his new assignment. Kampong Thom Province Found 26 Kovid Patients and 1 Healed
