(Phnom Penh): Ms. O Vandin, Secretary of State and Spokesperson of the Ministry of Health and Chair of the Commission for the Prevention of Kovid 19 Vaccine, appealed to the people who came to be vaccinated against Kovid 19 to come. Timely as announced by the authorities to avoid expiration and delay in receiving the second dose.
In addition, she added, "Separately, people who inject the first dose and do not forget to inject the second dose, in the past observed that some of our people have problems when the second dose is overdue and the location is Moved away because the day did not come. "Therefore, people should be very careful of this potential problem to be injected in all doses to create antibodies in our body to prevent Kovid 19."
Ms. O Vandin added that it is very important for people to remember to make a clear stamp when they come to receive the vaccine in two doses. In addition, if it is not your turn, do not come, which leads to too much accumulation, as it is a risk factor for Kovid 19 infection, please follow the instructions of the local authorities of the designated doctors. Go by this time.
This statement was made by Mrs. O Vandin during the visit to the vaccination site in Kampong Speu province at the end of June. Nearly 20,000 high-risk target groups in Pursat province rush to vaccinate Kovid 19 before authorities close by July 3
